{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wicked Cabins is a cozy diorama builder with a spooky twist. There are no rules, no timers, and no goals\u2014just pure creative freedom to build eerie little hideaways in the world\u2019s most haunted, cursed, or downright infernal locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own peaceful retreat in the game's main location:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f The Woods - Where mushrooms glow and cauldrons bubble, set up your perfect spell-crafting little cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no stress\u2014just the joy of turning haunted spaces into heartfelt ones. Take your time. Even the darkest places can eventually feel like home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106460?t=1760539545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106460/6324fb9d5c0cdff7517163cd6a7820a462a602ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760539545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106460/f5635ea4287c1d1424d1e6a996bd13d39cce8820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760539545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106460/f5635ea4287c1d1424d1e6a996bd13d39cce8820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760539545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wicked Cabins is a cozy diorama builder with a spooky twist. There are no rules, no timers, and no goals\u2014just pure creative freedom to build eerie little hideaways in the world\u2019s most haunted, cursed, or downright infernal locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own peaceful retreat in the g